title: "[Activity] FluentAssertionPattern.Rewrite → BeEquivalentToStringPattern.RewriteAssertion - Fixed of Manual" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
vars: {
  d2-legend: {
    f: Fixed {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"}
    m: Manual {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"}
  }
}
start: "" {shape: circle; width: 20; style: {fill: black; stroke: "#9ca3af"}}
q1: "Vorm x.Should().BeEquivalentTo(...)?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: BeEquivalentTo(...) is not in the form x.Should()...\n(proof: and-chain)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q2: "BeEquivalentTo, niet NotBeEquivalentTo?" {shape: diamond}
m2: "Manual: NotBeEquivalentTo has no Shouldly equivalent\n(proof: not-equivalent)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q3: "Resultaat weggegooid?" {shape: diamond}
m3: "Manual: The result of BeEquivalentTo(...) is used\n(proof: chain, value-used)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q4: "Argumenten splitsbaar?\n(becauseArgs alleen met constante because)" {shape: diamond}
m4: "Manual: named arguments, or becauseArgs\n(geen proof; because-args is Fixed)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
s: "Is er een because?" {shape: diamond}
f1: "Fixed: s.ShouldBe(\"x\", StringCompareShould.IgnoreCase)\n(proof: simple, lambda, edge-interpolated)" {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
f2: "Fixed: s.ShouldBe(\"x\", because, StringCompareShould.IgnoreCase)\nbecauseArgs → string.Format(...)\n(proof: because, because-args)" {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
start -> q1
q1 -> m1: nee
q1 -> q3: ja
q3 -> m3: nee
q3 -> q4: ja
q4 -> m4: nee
q4 -> q2: ja
q2 -> m2: nee
q2 -> s: ja
s -> f1: "nee"
s -> f2: "ja"
